      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm having an issue with some walnut I'm working with for a cabinet project. I'm cutting dovetails by hand, but I keep getting these small splinters and tear-outs right at the tips of the pins. It's ruining the fit. Any idea what I might be doing wrong with my chisel or my grain direction?",
